&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;a href=&quot;http://prenuvo.com/&quot;&gt;Prenuvo&lt;/a&gt;, we are on a mission to flip the paradigm from reactive “sick-care” to proactive health care. Our award-winning whole body scan is fast (under 1 hour), safe (MRI has no ionizing radiation), and non-invasive (no contrast). Our unique integrated stack of optimized hardware, software, and increasingly AI, coupled with the patient-centric experience across our domestic and global clinics, have allowed us to lead the change against “we caught it too late again&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to Executive Medical Leadership, the Medical Director, UAE will lead Prenuvo&#39;s clinical operations in Dubai while maintaining an active clinical practice. This is a highly visible leadership role responsible for ensuring exceptional patient care, supporting physician excellence, driving quality initiatives, and representing Prenuvo within the UAE healthcare community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unlike a traditional Medical Director role, this position combines clinical leadership, radiology expertise, operational partnership, physician mentorship, and patient engagement. The successful candidate will help shape Prenuvo&#39;s model of preventative healthcare while serving as a trusted clinical leader for both patients and physicians.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role does not provide visa sponsorship. Applicants must be legally authorized to work in the UAE at the time of hire and must be able to maintain valid work authorization for the duration of their employment.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help reshape the world through proactive healthcare while working with cutting-edge technology and high performing teams with deep expertise - join us to make a difference in people’s lives!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clinical Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the clinical strategy and medical operations for Prenuvo Radiology UAE.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an active clinical workload (up to &lt;strong&gt;50%&lt;/strong&gt;) through whole-body MRI interpretation and patient imaging report review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support complex case reviews and provide second opinions when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the senior clinical resource for physicians, radiologists, and clinic teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the global clinical leadership team to uphold Prenuvo&#39;s global clinical standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality &amp;amp; Physician Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead clinical quality assurance initiatives, including peer review, discrepancy audits, and continuous improvement programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor radiologists and partner physicians through ongoing education and performance feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support physician onboarding, credentialing, and professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of clinical excellence, accountability, and patient-first care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Patient Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage complex patient cases, escalations, and clinical complaints with empathy and professionalism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure a consistently exceptional patient experience aligned with Prenuvo&#39;s premium care model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trust with patients by providing clear, compassionate communication throughout their care journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market &amp;amp; Business Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as Prenuvo&#39;s clinical representative within the UAE healthcare community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with referring physicians, healthcare partners, and regulatory stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide insight into local healthcare trends, physician recruitment, and market opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Operations, Product, Quality, and Commercial teams to optimise clinical workflows and scale the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clinical Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the implementation of AI-enabled workflows and advancements in preventative imaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardise reporting, clinical pathways, and best practices across the UAE clinic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion innovation while ensuring the highest standards of patient safety and clinical governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical degree with specialist certification in Radiology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active Dubai Health Authority (DHA) medical license.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 3 years&#39; experience practicing within the UAE healthcare system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internationally trained physician (preference for medical degree and Radiology training to be completed from UK, Australia, United States or internationally recognised European healthcare system)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of UAE healthcare regulations, licensing requirements, and clinical governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience interpreting MRI studies in a high-quality diagnostic imaging environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience leading physicians or multidisciplinary clinical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success driving quality improvement and physician development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong clinical judgment with the ability to manage complex patient situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and relationship-building skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience leading a private for-profit clinical enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience implementing novel clinical technology and services ahead of consensus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal Candidate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a physician who combines:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional bedside manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of the UAE healthcare landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for preventative medicine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial awareness and business acumen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-growing, innovative healthcare environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with and accepting of the ambiguity of a start-up environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with taking calculated risks as part of a broader team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;First: we are &lt;strong&gt;Pioneers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transforming healthcare requires divergent thinking, bias for action, disciplined experimentation, and consistent grit and determination to maintain momentum. This journey is as challenging as it is rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Second: we are &lt;strong&gt;Platform-Builders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re always building foundations that allow us to achieve tomorrow more than we did today. We never lose sight of what’s ahead – in a mindset of ownership and duty to our mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all: we are &lt;strong&gt;Patients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We could all be the next person who walks through our very doors, seeking clarity or peace of mind. We are proud of our impact on our patients’ lives, and we won’t stop till everyone can benefit from our work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the future of preventative healthcare in the UAE, bringing a new approach to proactive, data-driven health and early detection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape a first-of-its-kind patient experience, setting a new standard for personalised, preventative healthcare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with global clinical and technology leaders at the forefront of advanced MRI, AI and preventative medicine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a key role in establishing and scaling Prenuvo across the Middle East, helping shape our clinical vision and regional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance meaningful clinical practice with strategic leadership, remaining close to patients while influencing clinical standards, innovation and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a mission-driven global organisation transforming how people understand and manage their long-term health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive executive compensation and benefits package, reflective of the scope and impact of the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of the hiring process, successful candidates will undergo a background check in compliance to applicable federal, provincial, and state rules.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please be advised that official communication from our recruitment team will only come from our authorized domain [&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://prenuvo.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;prenuvo.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;]. If you are contacted by a recruiter, please ensure their email address ends with @prenuvo.com. We do not use third-party recruitment services or any other email domains for hiring purposes. If you receive communication that you believe to be fraudulent, please report it immediately to jobs@prenuvo.com.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
